---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Licensing & Documentation — Exporta Global" description="End-to-end support for export licenses, certificates of origin, and customs paperwork — so nothing stalls your shipment at the border.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Licensing & Documentation</div>
    <span class="pill">Licensing & Documentation</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Licensing & Documentation</h1>
    <p class="sub">End-to-end support for export licenses, certificates of origin, and customs paperwork — so nothing stalls your shipment at the border.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Get a Free Consultation →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Get the paperwork right the first time.</h2>
      <p>Documentation errors are a leading cause of held shipments, fines, and lost time. The requirements differ by product, destination, and trade agreement.</p><p>We handle the full documentation chain — from licensing and certificates to customs declarations — and even show you how to export legally without your own license when that's the smarter route.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Export license guidance</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Certificates of origin</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>HS-code classification</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Customs declarations</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>License-free export routes</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Per-shipment compliance checklist</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Export licensing</h3><p>Guidance and support to obtain the right licenses for your product.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Certificates of origin</h3><p>Correctly prepared CoO and trade-agreement documents.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg></div><h3>Customs paperwork</h3><p>Accurate declarations and HS-code classification.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="17 1 21 5 17 9"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><polyline points="7 23 3 19 7 15"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg></div><h3>License-free routes</h3><p>How to export legally without your own license when it makes sense.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="3.01" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="3.01" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="3.01" y2="18"/></svg></div><h3>Compliance checklist</h3><p>A per-shipment checklist so nothing is missed.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Authority liaison</h3><p>We help you navigate the relevant trade and customs bodies.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear, proven process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Assess</h3><p>We review your product, destination, and current documents.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Prepare</h3><p>We compile and check every required document.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Submit</h3><p>We guide submission to the right authorities.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Clear</h3><p>Your shipment moves without paperwork delays.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Can you help me get an export license?</h4><p>Yes — we guide you through the full application and, where appropriate, show you compliant license-free options.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>What if my documents were rejected before?</h4><p>We audit what went wrong and rebuild the documentation correctly so it clears.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Do requirements change by country?</h4><p>Significantly. We tailor every document set to your specific destination and trade agreements.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="licensing & documentation" selectedService="Licensing & Documentation" />
</BaseLayout>
